# Sociva traffic architecture (always on)

Before backend/feature work, read and follow `.cursor/skills/sociva-traffic-architecture/SKILL.md`.
This is a **build-time** skill - do not open a full traffic audit unless the user asks.

Non-negotiables:
1. Any RPC that calls `sociva_assert_rate_limit` must be **VOLATILE**.
2. Never weaken RLS, rate limits, upload caps, webhook auth, or payment controls to ship.
3. Society ops stay membership-scoped; marketplace radius is a commerce exception, not an ops leak fix.
4. Staging default: `wwuanzbusxoyzixuprxs`. Production `kkzkuyhgdvyecmxtmkpy` only with explicit authorization.
5. Prefer existing Vercel + Supabase + Upstash patterns - do not invent nginx or new cache layers.
